{"id":2729,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为深化党性教育，传承红色精神，感悟新时代发展脉搏，2026年4月24日25日，马克思主义学院思想政治教育专业研究生党支部前往西柏坡、白洋淀、雄安印象城市厅，开展主题党日活动，让党员们在实地参观中坚定理想信念，汲取奋进力量。<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8QH2M77ZMlW7ngN-Doz9bMRNsLzvL4M7M7MzvbozU8LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPnkhknkysUzAfMRAfnmGZMmWfUzNDL7lPLm9bnz7PUmVFLllso7r2MRnFMlr7UlLJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6865&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/01DBD7A8A48AF0862AA960E1289E11B1/1E78EF44/5EDAC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 1px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8QH2M77ZMlW7ngN-Doz9bMRNsLzvL4M7M7MzvbozU8LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPnkhknkysUzAfMRAfnmGZMmWfUzNDL7lPLm9bnz7PUmVFLllso7r2MRnFMlr7UlLJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6865&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8QH2M77ZMlW7ngN-Doz9bMRNsLzvL4M7M7MzvbozU8LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPnkhknkysUzAfMRAfnmGZMmWfUzNDL7lPLm9bnz7PUmVFLllso7r2MRnFMlr7UlLJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6865&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/01DBD7A8A48AF0862AA960E1289E11B1/1E78EF44/5EDAC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"414\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8QH2M77ZMlW7ngN-Doz9bMRNsLzvL4M7M7MzvbozU8LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPnkhknkysUzAfMRAfnmGZMmWfUzNDL7lPLm9bnz7PUmVFLllso7r2MRnFMlr7UlLJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6865&e=.png\"></p><p>在西柏坡，党员们走进革命旧址与纪念馆，驻足观看珍贵文物、历史照片，重温党中央在艰苦环境中指挥全国革命胜利的光辉岁月，深刻领会“两个务必”的深邃内涵，感悟革命先辈坚守初心、艰苦奋斗的革命精神。来到白洋淀，大家追忆雁翎队英勇抗日的战斗故事，感受芦苇荡间的红色记忆，铭记革命先烈为民族解放抛洒热血的家国情怀，进一步厚植爱国爱党情怀。在雄安印象城市厅，党员们通过沙盘模型、数字影像等，沉浸式领略雄安新区从规划蓝图到实景建设的非凡成就，感受新时代国家战略的宏伟气魄与创新发展的蓬勃生机。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLN-HiMmGaolLDMgz-YU4lsUNMkM7rLfnNrknmNsM8CiMz70gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRMSyiL1ysnlCDLlnVLmTVoRNZMR78UzrfnR6VLll8UzrFnNr7M8Linm6FMmUiL8-Jv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6865&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FC5527EF61DE29E898414A5AD7E1E4A5/FED7C5F7/6453B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 451px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WLN-HiMmGaolLDMgz-YU4lsUNMkM7rLfnNrknmNsM8CiMz70gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRMSyiL1ysnlCDLlnVLmTVoRNZMR78UzrfnR6VLll8UzrFnNr7M8Linm6FMmUiL8-Jv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6865&e=.png\"></p><p>此次主题党日活动，是一次深刻的红色洗礼与思想淬炼。党员们纷纷表示，将把革命精神融入日常学习与工作，牢记初心使命，以更加饱满的热情、务实的作风履职尽责，在新时代征程中勇担使命、主动作为，以实际行动践行党员的责任与担当。<br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8QH2M77ZMlW7ngN-Doz9bMRNsLzvL4M7M7MzvbozU8LmC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPnkhknkysUzAfMRAfnmGZMmWfUzNDL7lPLm9bnz7PUmVFLllso7r2MRnFMlr7UlLJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMmlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6865&e=.png"}